# Frontend Development Checklists

## Development Workflow Checklists

### Before Starting Development
- [ ] Review relevant module rules
- [ ] Review core rules for:
  - [ ] State management
  - [ ] Performance
  - [ ] Accessibility
  - [ ] Testing
  - [ ] Security
  - [ ] Error handling
  - [ ] Internationalization
  - [ ] Browser compatibility

### During Development
- [ ] Follow component structure rules (@frontend/component-structure.mdc)
- [ ] Use proper HAML syntax (@frontend/haml-attributes.mdc)
- [ ] Implement icons correctly (@frontend/icon-usage.mdc)
- [ ] Follow Tailwind conventions (@frontend/tailwind-conventions.mdc)
- [ ] Follow all core rules for:
  - [ ] State management
  - [ ] Performance
  - [ ] Accessibility
  - [ ] Testing
  - [ ] Security
  - [ ] Error handling
  - [ ] Internationalization
  - [ ] Browser compatibility

### After Development
- [ ] Verify no common mistakes
- [ ] Ensure proper documentation
- [ ] Test all states and edge cases

## Component Development Checklists

### New Component Checklist
- [ ] Check for existing similar components
- [ ] Follow component naming conventions
- [ ] Implement proper directory structure
- [ ] Separate presentation from logic
- [ ] Add proper documentation
- [ ] Include usage examples
- [ ] Add accessibility attributes
- [ ] Test responsive behavior
- [ ] Add proper error handling
- [ ] Include loading states

### Template Modification Checklist
- [ ] Check HAML syntax
- [ ] Verify Tailwind class usage
- [ ] Ensure proper indentation
- [ ] Check for accessibility
- [ ] Verify responsive behavior
- [ ] Test all states (loading, error, empty)
- [ ] Check for performance impact
- [ ] Verify proper data loading
- [ ] Test edge cases

### Style Update Checklist
- [ ] Use Tailwind utilities
- [ ] Follow mobile-first approach
- [ ] Check for existing similar styles
- [ ] Document custom classes
- [ ] Test responsive behavior
- [ ] Verify browser compatibility
- [ ] Check for performance impact
- [ ] Test dark mode if applicable

### Icon Implementation Checklist
- [ ] Use humicon helper
- [ ] Add proper aria labels
- [ ] Set appropriate size
- [ ] Check for existing similar icons
- [ ] Verify accessibility
- [ ] Test hover/focus states
- [ ] Check color contrast

### Component Refactor Checklist
- [ ] Document current behavior
- [ ] Check for dependencies
- [ ] Plan migration strategy
- [ ] Update tests
- [ ] Verify accessibility
- [ ] Test all states
- [ ] Check performance
- [ ] Update documentation
- [ ] Test edge cases

### Validation Checklist
- [ ] All relevant module rules followed
- [ ] No common mistakes present
- [ ] Documentation complete
- [ ] Tests written and passing
- [ ] State management implemented correctly
- [ ] Performance optimizations in place
- [ ] Accessibility requirements met
- [ ] Test coverage meets requirements
- [ ] Security requirements met
- [ ] CSRF protection implemented
- [ ] XSS prevention in place
- [ ] Data protection implemented
- [ ] All core rules implemented and validated
